WEBVTT

00:09:28.792 --> 00:09:32.250
The bodies of the dead were of worth.

00:09:33.583 --> 00:09:38.976
Together, our ancestors enacted
a whole raft of rituals

00:09:39.000 --> 00:09:41.976
to bind up the wound of mortality,

00:09:42.000 --> 00:09:43.893
comfort the afflicted,

00:09:43.917 --> 00:09:45.643
bury their dead

00:09:45.667 --> 00:09:48.226
and get on with the rest of their lives.

00:09:48.250 --> 00:09:51.351
They gave of themselves freely.

00:09:51.375 --> 00:09:54.268
And they had a great time too,

00:09:54.292 --> 00:09:58.917
feasting, drinking,
and having sex at funerals.

00:09:59.792 --> 00:10:04.518
Death -- and here is a really big idea --